```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>抬餐人員排班表</title>

<style>
    * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
        font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f5f7fa;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 30px 15px;
        color: #333;
    }

    .container {
        max-width: 900px;
        margin: auto;
        background: white;
        padding: 30px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
    }

    h1 {
        text-align: center;
        margin-top: 0;
        color: #2c3e50;
    }

    .description {
        text-align: center;
        color: #777;
        margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .setting {
        background: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .setting h2 {
        margin-top: 0;
        font-size: 20px;
    }

    select {
        padding: 10px;
        font-size: 16px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        border: 1px solid #ccc;
        margin-left: 10px;
    }

    .holiday-list {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
        gap: 10px;
        margin-top: 15px;
    }

    .holiday {
        background: white;
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 12px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .holiday input {
        transform: scale(1.3);
        margin-right: 6px;
    }

    button {
        width: 100%;
        padding: 14px;
        border: none;
        border-radius: 10px;
        background: #3498db;
        color: white;
        font-size: 18px;
        cursor: pointer;
        margin-top: 10px;
    }

    button:hover {
        background: #2980b9;
    }

    .schedule {
        margin-top: 30px;
    }

    table {
        width: 100%;
        border-collapse: collapse;
        margin-top: 15px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 10px;
    }

    th {
        background: #34495e;
        color: white;
        padding: 14px;
    }

    td {
        border: 1px solid #ddd;
        padding: 14px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    tr:nth-child(even) {
        background: #f8f9fa;
    }

    .holiday-row {
        background: #ffecec !important;
        color: #d63031;
        font-weight: bold;
    }

    .number {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #3498db;
        color: white;
        border-radius: 50%;
